cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "agent-authorization-verifier"
abstract: >-
  Verification core for WIMSE workload-to-workload HTTP message signatures
  (draft-ietf-wimse-http-signature-09): a library and CLI producing
  two-layer judgments (artifact verdict plus twelve-stage failure
  classification) aligned with the WIMSE HTTP signature test vector suite.
authors:
